        <name>instruction_map</name>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Property: Cached map of instructions by address.</para><para>Returns the InstructionMap associated with an interpretation. The instruction map is recomputed if the currently cached map is empty or if the <computeroutput>recompute</computeroutput> argument is true. Otherwise this just returns the existing map. No attempt is made to make sure that the map is up-to-date with respect to the current state of the AST. </para>        </detaileddescription>
